  "details": "I’ve seen topics from people in VRChat who randomly get vote kicked by no structure reason from trolls or group members.\n\nThe karma point system hasn’t been suggested for the vote kick system, but here’s how it works (if you haven’t played Trouble in Terrorist Town in GMod):\n\n- You start with 1000 karma points for every instance you joined in VRChat.\n\n- You win karma points if you successfully vote kicked against a user (but only if anyone or you initiate a vote kick).\n\n- You will lose karma points if you failed (or anyone refused) to vote kick against a user.\n\n- If your karma points reached lower than 250 (or 500), you can’t initiate another vote kick against someone VRChat.\n\nI hope this feature helps improve the vote kick system and the overall experience in VRChat.",
